            "paragraph": "The models show that the excess organic carbon burial, caused by increased P-limited productivity, increases atmospheric O2 levels (Fig. 3e and k), and decreases atmospheric CO2 levels, which in turn lowers global temperatures by up to around 5\u00b0C (Fig. 3f and I). This model result aligns with carbonate and apatite \u03b418O values in the LOME and LDME, that record 5\u20137\u00b0C seawater temperature drops 5,36.",
